-- want --
dynaflux.lock:1:1: error DF6013
-- want-text --
dynaflux.lock:1:1: error DF6013: can't use dynaflux.lock: page_daily@v2 has rebuild count 1, more than its view's 0
  hint: if it has merge conflicts, keep the lock of the branch that merged first and run dynaflux generate; undo hand edits, and don't delete the file, which renumbers every view
